@startuml
title UML sequence behaviour — Record one second
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 12
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam ArrowColor #344054
skinparam rectangle {
  BorderColor #344054
  FontColor #101828
}
skinparam package {
  BorderColor #667085
  FontColor #101828
  BackgroundColor #F9FAFB
}
box "Frontend — Ride app" #E0F2FE
  participant "RideTicker" as ticker
  participant "RaceStore / ClassRideStore" as store
  participant "RideRecorder" as recorder
  participant "RideOutbox" as outbox
end box
ticker -> store : second n
store -> recorder : record(power, speed, n − last second)
note right of recorder
  Writes one speed per second into the fixed
  Float64Array(14400): a hidden tab's skipped
  seconds at the speed of the moment (L2-138 AC2).
  Totals are running sums; nothing grows (AC1).
end note
...the ride finishes...
store -> recorder : facts(finishedAt)
recorder --> store : RideFacts, speedSamplesKmh one a second
store -> outbox : submit(ride)
note over store, recorder : Leaving the screen releases the store and its recorder
@enduml
